# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# pcb_twin.pcb -- Two alike filters laid out by groups, the second a copy
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Each filter is a block laid out alone; b has a's statements, renamed,
# so its copper is a's, moved.
netlist pcb_twin.nl
board rect 0 0 40 20
layer top signal
layer bottom plane GND
footprint resistor r0603
footprint capacitor c0603

fix a.r at 10 10
fix b.r at 25 10
block a
block b

place a.c right from a.r.2
place b.c right from b.r.2
